@startuml
[*] --> NoAssignment
NoAssignment --> ManualAssignment : User assigns group
NoAssignment --> AutomaticAssignment : System auto-assigns
ManualAssignment --> [*] : Delete assignment
ManualAssignment --> Tracking : Continue tracking
AutomaticAssignment --> [*] : Delete assignment
AutomaticAssignment --> Tracking : Continue tracking
Tracking --> [*] : Complete
@enduml
